 text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); text-rendering: optimizelegibility; letter-spacing: 0.14px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;"><strong style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;">2. Du lịch Vĩnh Hy – Vẻ đẹp hoang sơ giữa lòng Ninh Thuận</strong></h4><p style="margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Calibri, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;">Vịnh Vĩnh Hy thuộc Ninh Thuận đang dần trở thành “ngôi sao mới” của du lịch Việt Nam. Với những bờ biển xanh ngọc bích, rạn san hô đầy màu sắc và làng chài yên bình. Du lịch Vĩnh Hy mang đến cho du khách trải nghiệm hòa mình vào thiên nhiên hoang sơ. Đây chắc chắn là điểm đến lý tưởng cho những ai yêu thích khám phá và chụp ảnh.</p><div id="attachment_485772" class="wp-caption alignnone" style="margin: 0.4em auto 1.25em; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Calibri, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; display: block; max-width: 96%; text-align: center; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); letter-spacing: 0.14px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 970px;"><img decoding="async" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-485772" class="wp-image-485772 size-full lazyloaded" data-src="https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2024/12/2-4.png" alt="" width="960" height="540" data-srcset="https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2024/12/2-4.png 960w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2024/12/2-4-540x305.png 540w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2024/12/2-4-250x142.png 250w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2024/12/2-4-768x432.png 768w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2024/12/2-4-750x422.png 750w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2024/12/2-4-225x127.png 225w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2024/12/2-4-370x208.png 370w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2024/12/2-4-50x28.png 50w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2024/12/2-4-107x60.png 107w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2024/12/2-4-195x110.png 195w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2024/12/2-4-220x125.png 220w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2024/12/2-4-400x225.png 400w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2