 Ích Khiêm).</em></p><p style="margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Calibri, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><strong style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;">Bán đảo Sơn Trà/ Núi Khỉ<br></strong></p><div id="attachment_436688" class="wp-caption aligncenter" style="margin: 0.4em auto 1.25em; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Calibri, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; display: block; max-width: 96%; text-align: center; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); letter-spacing: 0.14px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 1210px;"><a href="https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2023/10/du-lich-da-nang-ivivu-9.jpg" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(47, 128, 237); text-decoration: none; transition: 0.2s; outline: 0px;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-436688" class="size-full wp-image-436688 lazyloaded" data-src="https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2023/10/du-lich-da-nang-ivivu-9.jpg" alt="Ảnh: VnExpress" width="1200" height="799" data-srcset="https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2023/10/du-lich-da-nang-ivivu-9.jpg 1200w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2023/10/du-lich-da-nang-ivivu-9-458x305.jpg 458w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2023/10/du-lich-da-nang-ivivu-9-1024x682.jpg 1024w" data-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" src="https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2023/10/du-lich-da-nang-ivivu-9.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" srcset="https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2023/10/du-lich-da-nang-ivivu-9.jpg 1200w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2023/10/du-lich-da-nang-ivivu-9-458x305.jpg 458w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2023/10/du-lich-da-nang-ivivu-9-1024x682.jpg 1024w" style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; height: auto; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.4s; display: block; --smush-placeholder-width: 1200px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1200/799;"></a><p id="caption-attachment-436688" class="wp-caption-text" style="margin: 10px 0px 1.25em; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: italic; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0.92857rem; line-height: 1.39286rem; font-family: &quot;Roboto Slab&quot;, Palatino, Cambria, &quot;Droid Serif&quot;, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Ảnh: VnExpress</p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Calibri, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;">Nằm cách trung tâm thành phố Đà Nẵng 10 km về phía Đông, Sơn Trà được xem là “viên ngọc quý”. Với bờ biển dài, uốn lượn, cùng hệ động thực vật đa dạng. Bán đảo nằm trong địa bàn phường Thọ Quang, quận Sơn Trà có diện tích 4.439 ha đất liền. Nơi đây có bờ biển kéo dài, trong xanh quanh năm, cùng đèo Hải Vân bao bọc thành phố Đà Nẵng và vịnh Đà Nẵng.</p><p style="margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Calibri, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;">Đến Bán đảo Sơn Trà bạn có thể tham khảo một số điểm tham quan hút khách khác như: đỉnh Bàn Cờ, cây đa ngàn năm, hải đăng Sơn Trà, Ghềnh Bàng, Hồ Xanh, chùa Linh Ứng,…</p><div id="attachment_361985" class="wp-caption aligncenter" style="margin: 0.4em auto 1.25em; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Calibri, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; display: block; max-width: 96%; text-align: center; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); letter-spacing: 0.14px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-tran