ation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;">tour du lịch Đà Nẵng</em><span>&nbsp;</span>đi bán đảo Sơn Trà.</p><p style="margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Calibri, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;"><a href="https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2023/10/du-lich-da-nang-ivivu-12.jpg" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(47, 128, 237); text-decoration: none; transition: 0.2s; outline: 0px;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-436693 lazyloaded" data-src="https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2023/10/du-lich-da-nang-ivivu-12.jpg" alt="du-lich-da-nang-ivivu-12" width="700" height="463" data-srcset="https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2023/10/du-lich-da-nang-ivivu-12.jpg 700w, https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2023/10/du-lich-da-nang-ivivu-12-461x305.jpg 461w" data-sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw,