 Kiệt 47 Lý Thái Tổ, thành phố Đà Nẵng</p><p style="margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Calibri, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;">Mít trộn 468 Trưng Nữ Vương -Số 468 Trưng Nữ Vương, Đà Nẵng</p><h4 style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 1.14286rem; line-height: 1.71429rem; font-family: &quot;Roboto Slab&quot;, Palatino, Cambria, &quot;Droid Serif&quot;, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); text-rendering: optimizelegibility; letter-spacing: 0.14px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style