ertical-align: baseline; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); text-rendering: optimizelegibility; letter-spacing: 0.14px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><strong style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;">4.<a href="https://www.ivivu.com/khach-san-da-nang/melia-vinpearl-da-nang-riverfront?utm_source=blog_ivivu&amp;utm_medium=post_link&amp;utm_campaign=internal" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(47, 128, 237); text-decoration: none; transition: 0.2s; outline: 0px;"><span id="hotel-name-detail" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><span>&nbsp;</span>Khách sạn Meliá Vinpearl Đà Nẵng Riverfront</span></a></strong></h4><p style="margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Calibri, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;">Khách sạn Meliá Vinpearl Đà Nẵng Riverfront là khách sạn 5 sao nằm tại thành phố Đà Nẵng sôi động. Với vị trí thuận lợi bên bờ sông Hàn, khách sạn tọa lạc trong khu vực trung tâm thành phố, cách sân bay quốc tế Đà Nẵng khoảng 6 km và gần các điểm tham quan nổi tiếng như cầu Rồng, bãi biển Mỹ Khê và bán đảo Sơn Trà cũng như chùa Linh Ứng…</p><p style="margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Calibri, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;"><a href="https://cdn3.ivivu.com/2023/07/Meli%C3%A1-Vinpearl-%C4%90a-Nang-Riverfront-ivivu-1.jpg" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-